OL,4,CNew guidance launched after baby sling 
OL,5,Cdeath                                  
OL,6,GThe parents of a young baby who died   
OL,7,Gafter suffocating in a baby sling are  
OL,8,Gsupporting new guidance to prevent     
OL,9,Gsimilar tragedies.                     
OL,11,FGeorge and Ellie Alderman's son Jimmy  
OL,12,Fstopped breathing while being carried  
OL,13,Fin a baby sling in October 2023.       
OL,15,FThe guidance for the use of slings and 
OL,16,Fbaby carriers has been launched by the 
OL,17,Fcharity, The Lullaby Trust, with chief 
OL,18,Fexecutive Jenny Ward saying it was     
OL,19,Ftheir "responsibility to act when the  
OL,20,Fsafety of babies was at risk".         
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
