OL,4,CPolice car damaged in shop window crash
OL,5,GA police car smashed into a shop       
OL,6,Gwindow in Kent, following a crash with 
OL,7,Ganother vehicle.                       
OL,9,FA Kent Police patrol was responding to 
OL,10,Fan emergency call shortly before 20:30 
OL,11,FGMT on Wednesday at the time of the    
OL,12,Fincident in Tunbridge Wells, according 
OL,13,Fto the force.                          
OL,15,FThe junction of Grosvenor Road and     
OL,16,FHanover Road in the Kent town was      
OL,17,Fclosed by police, after the police car 
OL,18,Fcollided with the window of the Dream  
OL,19,FDoors showroom.                        
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
