OL,4,CMore than 885,000 trees planted,       
OL,5,Ccouncil hears                          
OL,6,GMore than 885,000 trees have been      
OL,7,Gplanted in Surrey in the last seven    
OL,8,Gyears, a council meeting has heard.    
OL,10,FSurrey County Council introduced a     
OL,11,Ftarget in 2019 to plant 1.2 million    
OL,12,Fnew trees by 2030, representing one    
OL,13,Ffor every resident.                    
OL,15,FThe total includes trees planted by    
OL,16,Fthe council, schools, businesses,      
OL,17,Fcharities and community groups, as     
OL,18,Fwell as woodland and hedgerow schemes. 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
